{"sourceUrl":"https://www.phbs.pku.edu.cn/info/1801/180531.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:11.622078+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.phbs.pku.edu.cn/info/1801/180531.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>北京大学汇丰商学院将在</span>2026<span>年秋季</span></span><span><span>组织</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>（西方经济学）推免面试</span></span><span><span>，欢迎应届本科毕业生积极</span></span><span><span>报名参加</span></span><span><span>。申请直博项目的报名时间、报名办法和流程等相关要求具体如下：</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>一、 </span><strong><span><span>基本条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、</span></span><span><span>全国高校</span>2027<span>年应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，品行端正，遵纪守法。</span></span></p><p><span>3<span>、申请人需对经济学有强烈的学术研究兴趣和潜力，具有一定经济学基础和数学功底；同时欢迎对经济学研究有浓厚兴趣的理工科学生报考。</span></span></p><p><span>4<span>、品质优秀，能力突出，思维敏捷，能够认同北京大学汇丰商学院的办学理念和培养模式。</span></span></p><p><span>5<span>、具备良好的英语能力：博士课程使用全英语教学。应具备利用英语进行科研、论文写作以及学术交流的能力。英语成绩达到以下任何一项：</span></span></p><p><br/></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>认可项目</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>有效期</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>外语水平要求</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>GRE</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2022</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日后参加考试</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>320</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>TOEFL</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日后参加考试</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>100</span><span>（听说读写各单科不低于</span><span>22</span><span>分）</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>WSK(PETS 5)</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>不限</span></p></td><td><p><span>合格</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>雅思</span><span>A</span><span>类</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日后参加考试</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>6.5</span><span>（听说读写各单科不低于</span><span>6</span><span>分）</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>CET</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>不限</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>CET</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>6</span><span>≥</span><span>550</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>英语专业四级或八级</span></p></td><td><p><span>不限</span></p></td><td><p><span>合格</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>论文</span></p></td><td><p><span>不限</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>英文</span><span>SSCI</span><span>一作</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br/></p><p><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、</span></span><span><span>直博生推免面试</span></span><span><span>报名表（在系统内填写后生成，生成后务必核对信息无误）。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、个人陈述（系统内下载模板，中英文各一份）。</span></span></p><p><span>3<span>、专家推荐信</span></span><span>3<span>封（系统内下载模板），即需要</span><span>3</span></span><span><span>位学界或行业专家分别推荐，专家须为所报学科专业领域内的副教授（含）以上或具有相当专业技术职称</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>推荐信须密封并在封口骑缝处签字。</span></span></p><p><span>4<span>、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文</span></span><span>1<span>篇</span></span><strong><span><span>（</span>PDF<span>格式）</span></span></strong><span><span>，写作语言可为中文或英文。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span><span>、本科阶段成绩单</span><span>1</span><span>份及排名证明</span><span>1</span><span>份：排名证明为大学前六学期总评成绩的排名证明，系统内可下载模板并在线上传（原则上需提供前六学期成绩单及排名证明；如情况特殊的，可提供前五学期的相应文件），需由教务部门盖章。有双学位或辅修经历的申请者提供双学位成绩单或辅修证明。</span></span></p><p><span>6<span>、英文能力证明（如六级、托福、雅思、</span><span>GRE</span><span>等）。</span></span></p><p><span>7<span>、个人简历（中英文各一份）。</span></span></p><p><span>8<span>、其他证明材料，包括出版物或原创性工作成果、获奖证书等，请扫描成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件集中提交。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>**<span>申请者应保证所提交的所有电子信息及纸版材料的真实性、有效性、完整性，如因不实信息或者伪造材料所造成的后果完全由本人承担。</span><span>** </span></span></strong></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请流程</span></span></strong><span><br/></span><strong><span><span>（一）报名申请</span></span></strong><span><br/></span><span>1<span>、请登录<strong>北京大学研究生招生网</strong></span></span><strong><span><span>（</span>https://admission.pku.edu.cn<span>）</span></span></strong><span><span>，注册登录后点击</span><span>“</span><span>网上报名</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>，选择</span><span>“西方经济学”专业</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>层次</span></span><span><span>为</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>博士</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、请登录</span></span><strong><span><span>北京大学汇丰商学院申请系统（</span>https://maapply.phbs.pku.edu.cn<span>）</span></span></strong><span><span>，在线填报并提交上述材料。</span></span> </p><p><span><strong><span>系统开通时间为</span></strong><strong><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>0:00-2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span>8</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span>1</span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>:00</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p><p><span>3. 材料提交</span></p><p><strong><span><span>请于</span><span>2026年9月8日10:00前在</span></span></strong><strong><span>北京大学研究生招生网、</span></strong><strong><span><span>北大汇丰商学院网上申请系统提交电子版材料；</span><span>2026年9月</span></span></strong><strong><span>10</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>17:00前通过“顺丰快递”寄达纸质版材料（纸质版材料以邮件签收时间为准）</span></span></strong><span>，纸质材料一经提交，不予退回。</span></p><p><span><span>邮寄地址：广东省深圳市南山区西丽大学城北京大学汇丰商学院</span><span>114办公室</span></span></p><p><span>收件人：博士项目招生</span></p><p><span><span>邮编：</span><span>518055</span></span></p><p><span><span>办公电话：</span><span>0755-</span></span><span>26033166</span></p><p><span><span>温馨提示：邮寄时请勿勾选</span><span>“隐藏地</span></span><span><span>址</span><span>”</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）申请材料审核及</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>面试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>资格确认</span></span></strong><span><br/></span><span>1<span>、所有申请材料将由专门工作委员会负责进行初选。因申请材料较多，恕不提供电话确认，请自行确保递交材料的完整性，所有申请材料只适用于当次申请。</span></span></p><p><span>2<span>、我院将以电子邮件形式通知申请者本人是否获得</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>资格，获得</span></span><span><span>资格</span></span><span><span>进入</span></span><span><span>推免面试环节</span></span><span><span>的申请人于</span></span><strong><span>9<span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>中下</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>旬</span></span></strong><span><span>在北京大学汇丰商学院（深圳）参加直博生</span></span><span><span>推免面试</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>3<span>、申请者应仔细核对本人是否符合申请条件，一经发现申请者不符合申请条件将不予录取，已录取者取消录取资格。相关后果由申请者本人承担。</span> </span></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span><span>（三）注意事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span>(1)</span> <strong><span><span>申请流程中的两步填报须全部完成，</span></span></strong><span><span>并保证所有上传信息</span></span><span><span>与纸质材料</span></span><span><span>完全一致，</span></span><span><span>材料按时寄达，</span></span><span><span>否则将视为无效报名。</span></span></p><p><span>(2)</span> <span><span>系统中所填写的</span><span>“</span><span>所在学校</span><span>”</span><span>，必须与成绩单上的校名一致。如分校、校区等。系统填报时，</span><span>“</span><span>所在学校</span><span>”</span><span>一栏，请选择</span><span>“</span><span>其他</span><span>”</span><span>并输入所在学校名称，否则可能被视为无效报名。</span></span></p><p><span>(3)</span> <span><span>系统中</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>各项</span></span><span><span>申请</span></span><span><span>信息</span></span><span><span>由</span></span><span><span>申请者</span></span><span><span>本人</span></span><span><span>确认</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>提交后不能修改。</span></span></p><p><span>(4)</span> <span><span>申请材料一经收到，恕不退还。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、招生咨询</span></span></strong><span><br/></span><span><span>电话：</span>0755-26033166<span>，</span><span>0755-26039928</span></span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>phd.admission@phbs.pku.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><span>咨询时间：周一至周五上午</span>9</span><span><span>:</span><span>00-12</span><span>:</span><span>00</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院官网</span>: www.phbs.pku.edu.cn</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"f7109d4cc2c9f6bfcb28bfecf08714c0231414bdc3bee3d58f5f639efa444855","textLength":1872,"sourceSha256":"1466913246719be6cd705ee798f3e2d24130853d2dcda19de80ec029064decaa","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4d2d667ed62384ae1023","title":"2026年北京大学汇丰商学院接收2027年免试研究生（直博生）的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:11.622078+00:00"}
